      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Biggest questions to be asking are the following:\n-Does this fix audio crackling issues and microstuttering caused by the plugin in environments on avatars? (took a long time to actually pin down the cause, removing the plugin dll actually eliminated a lot of stuttering and fps spiking)\n-Can you animate values on audio sources (such as fading volume or pitch) without it obliterating the audio into a nightmarish crackly scratchy mess?\n(both of which are issues that have plagued animators for a very long time)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
